  {
    "id": 2015016030020,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "この日なら……\r\nスケジュール、夕方までだから……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201501603/2015016030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015016030030,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "夜、ゲーム配信……\r\nしてもいい……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201501603/2015016030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、問題ないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "配信の告知はもう少し近くなったらにしたいけど\r\nとりあえず、スケジュールには入れておくよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015016030040,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……\r\nありがと……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201501603/2015016030040"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──そして\r\n甜花、おめでとう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015016030050,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201501603/2015016030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花の頑張りが、\r\n新しい仕事に繋がったぞ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015016030060,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "え……\r\nえ……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201501603/2015016030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ゲーミングヘッドセットの\r\nイメージキャラクターのオファーが来てな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ゲーム用アクセサリメーカーのスタッフさんが\r\nこの前の甜花の配信を見てくれたそうでさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それでぜひ、\r\n甜花にお願いしたいと連絡をもらったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015016030070,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……す……\r\n……すごいね……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201501603/2015016030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015016030080,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "──……ツイスタの、投稿が……\r\nゲーム配信に、なって……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201501603/2015016030080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015016030090,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ゲーム配信が……\r\n新しいお仕事、なった……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201501603/2015016030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\n……うん、不思議な縁だよなぁ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015016030100,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……じゃあ……\r\n……──",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
