  },
  {
    "id": 2015016030170,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あ、そだ──次の配信……\r\nもっと、ゲーム！　ってやつ……やった方が、いい……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201501603/2015016030170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……？\r\nどうしてだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015016030180,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "こないだは……\r\nヘッドセットとか、使わない感じの……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201501603/2015016030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015016030190,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "育成ゲームで……すごい\r\nまったりしてた、から……！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201501603/2015016030190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうか\r\nでも大丈夫だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その辺は気にせず、\r\n甜花がやりたいゲームをやるのが一番だと思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
